"description": "LPL Financial Holdings, Inc. operates as an advisor-mediated marketplace as an independent broker-dealer and is an investment advisory firm and a custodian. It offers integrated technology solutions, brokerage and advisory platforms, clearing, compliance, business and planning and advice services, consultative practice management programs, and training. The company provides personalized financial guidance to American families seeking wealth management, retirement planning, financial planning, and asset management solutions. LPL Financial Holdings was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in San Diego, CA.",
